{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05369","headline":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴 · 裴漼","name":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"问道图书盛，尊儒礼教兴。\n石渠因学广，金殿爲贤昇。\n日月恩光照，风云宠命膺。\n谋谟言可范，舟檝事斯凭。\n宴喜明时洽，光辉湛露凝。\n大哉尧作主，天下颂歌称。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴漼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05369.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05369","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}